  "source_boundary": "Original 109-source and 146-draft packets, pinned c11 runtime, prior specifically authorized source-only outputs and every exact inputs binding remain allowed. No candidates, scores, unrelated root docs/validation or task histories. Exact listed bindings determine this addendum scope.",
  "work": "Inspect each complete original subject meaning, stance, priority, aliases/access and original evidence claims/locator classes; examine actual mapped current parent/facet/exclusion and exact prior source-grounded dispositions. Record every exact old key and substantive retain/rebind/correct/retire decision. For evidence-only keys whose old subject was already reviewed, inspect full claim and actual mapping; no duplicate whole-subject claim. Reuse already inspected source passages and demonstrably identical complete fields with exact prior-ledger and literal-match pointer/digest references. Matching label/page or chapter association alone is not equivalent. Read remaining nonidentical original fields/claims and resolve dropped/changed source-supported distinctions. Historical requirements may be invalid and need justified retirement; do not add requirements merely to preserve counts. For the four evidence-only parents, inspect the complete original evidence and actual selected mapping without relabelling prior whole-subject inspection as your own. New source reading is after draft exposure. Full source is permitted, including newly needed pages; previous source-first scope must remain stated accurately.",
